+---
+id: task-002-record-createdat-and-updatedat-on-each-task
+type: task
+title: "Record createdAt and updatedAt on each task"
+status: pending
+---
+
+Added `createdAt` and `updatedAt` (ISO-8601) to `Task`; equal on add, `updatedAt` set on complete, reopen,
+rename, tag and untag. Time comes from an injected clock (see dl-002). Tests added in `test/list.test.ts`.
